# Code identifier allowlist for `tools/fleet-health --check identifiers`.
# One entry per line; `#` starts a comment. Entries are matched with
# fnmatch-style globs against the `Identifier=` line of `codesign -dvv`.
# An identifier with an LC_UUID-style suffix (e.g. `org.deskflow.deskflow-5555`)
# is NOT matched by the exact entries below and therefore fails the check.
#
# Binaries under Contents/MacOS/ (first-party) MUST match an entry here.
# Bundled third-party dylibs/plugins under Contents/Frameworks/ may instead
# carry codesign's filename-derived identifier (libpcre2-16.0.dylib -> libpcre2-16).
org.deskflow.deskflow
org.deskflow.deskflow-core
org.deskflow.deskflow-vhid-bridge
org.deskflow.deskflow-prio
io.github.hughesyadaddy.deskflow
io.github.hughesyadaddy.mouser
# Bundled Qt frameworks carry their own stable identifiers.
org.qt-project.*
